{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52894","headline":"见闻觉知偈 · 本净","name":"见闻觉知偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见闻觉知无障碍，声香味触常三昧。\n如鸟空中只没（《景德传灯录》作「麽」）飞，无取无舍无憎爱。\n若会应处本无心，方（《景德传灯录》作「始」）得名爲观自在。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}